# Sahil Shelote GitHub Repository (Rotation 1, Group 6)

## Introduction
This project focuses on identifying genomic changes in microorganism strains. We developed new assemblies for the samples using tools such as **Minimap2** and **Unicycler**. The quality of these assemblies was evaluated using **BUSCO** and **QUAST**. For visualization and annotation, we utilized **Flye**, **Prokka**, and **Genovi**.

## Things to Note
- Group 6 created this repository to store and manage the codebase for the analysis of a sample set of 6.
- All relevant scripts are stored in the repository under the file name `final`.
- The scripts were executed using `sbatch` scripts in an HPC environment.

## Installation and Tools
Below are the tools and their installation instructions:

- **Conda**:  
  `bash <conda-installer-name>-latest-MacOSX-x86_64.sh` (for macOS)
  
- **Nanoplot**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda nanoplot`
  
- **Minimap2**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda minimap2`  
  ![Install with Bioconda](https://img.shields.io/badge/install%20with-bioconda-brightgreen.svg?style=flat)
  
- **Unicycler**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda unicycler`  
  ![Install with Bioconda](https://img.shields.io/badge/install%20with-bioconda-brightgreen.svg?style=flat)

- **QUAST**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda quast`  
  ![Install with Bioconda](https://img.shields.io/badge/install%20with-bioconda-brightgreen.svg?style=flat)

- **BUSCO**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda busco`  
  [User Guide](https://busco.ezlab.org/busco_userguide.html)

- **Prokka**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda prokka`  
  [GitHub](https://github.com/tseemann/prokka)

- **Flye**:  
  `conda install flye`  
  [GitHub](https://github.com/fenderglass/Flye/blob/flye/docs/INSTALL.md)

- **Genovi**:  
  `conda install -c bioconda genovi`  
  [GitHub](https://github.com/robotoD/GenoVi)

